<title>SOUTH AFRICA: PALS SAYS IN TALKS, ADVISES CAUTION.</title>
<headline>PALS SAYS IN TALKS, ADVISES CAUTION.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pals Holdings Ltd said it was in negotiations which could affect its share price.</p>
<p>A brief notice advised shareholders to exercise caution in their share dealings, but did not give any further details.</p>
<p>--Johannesburg newsroom -27-11-482.1003</p>
